n\n编号已知时直接按编号取行（编号在第一列，行首匹配最准）：\n\n```bash\ngrep -m1 '^8.G.7,' references/standards.csv\n```\n\n按年级或领域筛选，只看编号和要求两列：\n\n```bash\nawk -F',' '$2==\"5\"' references/standards.csv | cut -d',' -f1,5\ngrep ',Geometry,' references/standards.csv | cut -d',' -f1,5\n```\n\n按关键词找（例如勾股定理相关）：\n\n```bash\ngrep -i 'pythagorean' references/standards.csv | cut -d',' -f1,2,5\n```\n\n`requirement` 字段里含逗号，所以取整行文本时用 `grep` 原样输出，别用 `cut` 切到第 5 列以后。\n\n## 回答约定\n\n- 引用课标要求时给出**原文**（英文）加编号，必要时再翻译。\n- 一并给出 `grade` / `domain` 和 `pdf_page`，方便回到 PDF 核对。\n- 表里没有的条目直说没有，不要照编号规律臆造。\n"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1788753230898},{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_283e71d98703496b8cdc04ec","name":"bash","arguments":{"command":"grep -m1 '^5.NF.4,' /Users/l/other_git_repos/calculus-quest/nodejs_react_lib/learn-claude-code/custom_skill_space/math-standards/references/standards.csv; grep -m1 '^4.MD.3,' /Users/l/other_git_repos/calculus-quest/nodejs_react_lib/learn-claude-code/custom_skill_space/math-standards/references/standards.csv; grep -m1 '^3.MD.7,' /Users/l/other_git_repos/calculus-quest/nodejs_react_lib/learn-claude-code/custom_skill_space/math-standards/references/standards.csv"}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_2b35037d2683464798ce2763","name":"bash","arguments":{"command":"grep -i 'tiled' /Users/l/other_git_repos/calculus-quest/nodejs_react_lib/learn-claude-code/custom_skill_space/math-standards/references/standards.csv | cut -d',' -f1,2; grep -i 'area of.*rect\\|rectangle' /Users/l/other_git_repos/calculus-quest/nodejs_react_lib/learn-claude-code/custom_skill_space/math-standards/references/standards.csv | cut -d',' -f1,2"}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"ark-plan","model":"glm-5.3","usage":{"input":672,"output":273,"cacheRead":2304,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":3249,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0},"cacheWrite1h":0},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1788753230900,"responseId":"021788753230992a6cdd8247c48d753298cd4bcf5eec90e